    {
      "beat_id": "B07",
      "act": "NEXT STEPS",
      "role_note": "what to do next",
      "narration_text": "Your move: for any LLM application where consistency matters, build a semantic variant set for your top ten most important queries. Run this agreement matrix. Set a minimum agreement rate threshold — ninety percent for advisory use, ninety-five for consequential decisions. If you cannot meet it, add a human review step or constrain the output format to a structured field.",
      "visual_intent": "next-steps card: 1) build semantic variant set for key queries, 2) measure agreement rate, 3) set threshold per risk level",
